<view class="page"
  ><view class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</view
  ><view class="title">你的拍摄，<view>正在发生。</view></view
  ><view class="muted"
    >从询单到交付，在这里查看进展。换手机后可用私人查询码找回，请勿公开分享查询码。</view
  >
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="notice">正在更新进展…</view
  ><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!loading &amp;&amp; !saved.length}}" class="empty-state"
    ><view class="card-title">故事，从一个想法开始。</view
    ><view class="muted">选好喜欢的风格，发来你的拍摄计划。</view
    ><button class="button" bindtap="book">计划我的拍摄 ↗</button></view
  >
  <view class="card" wx:for="{{saved}}" wx:key="token"
    ><block wx:if="{{item.order}}"
      ><view class="status-badge">{{item.label}}</view
      ><view class="card-title">{{item.packageLabel}}</view
      ><view>{{item.date}}</view><view class="muted">Brisbane 时间</view
      ><view wx:if="{{item.order.status!=='cancelled'}}" class="progress-track"
        ><view
          class="progress-step {{step.done?'done':''}}"
          wx:for="{{item.steps}}"
          wx:for-item="step"
          wx:key="id"
          >{{step.label}}</view
        ></view
      ><view wx:else class="notice">如需重新安排，请联系 Hannah 确认。</view
      ><view class="row"
        ><text>确认报价</text
        ><text
          >{{item.order.quote_amount==null?'待确认':'A$'+item.order.quote_amount}}</text
        ></view
      ><view class="row muted"
        ><text>已记录定金</text
        ><text>A${{item.order.deposit_paid||0}}</text></view
      ><view wx:if="{{item.order.film}}" class="muted"
        >包含加拍真实 35mm 胶片</view
      ><view class="muted space"
        >状态由工作室更新。如需更改日期或方案，请联系 Hannah。</view
      ></block
    ><view wx:else class="notice error">{{item.error}}</view
    ><view class="row"
      ><text class="small-link" data-token="{{item.token}}" bindtap="copy"
        >复制查询码</text
      ><text class="small-link" data-token="{{item.token}}" bindtap="forget"
        >从本机移除</text
      ></view
    ></view
  >
  <view class="section-number">找回已有询单</view
  ><input
    value="{{input}}"
    bindinput="input"
    maxlength="64"
    placeholder="粘贴完整私人查询码"
  /><button class="button" bindtap="add" disabled="{{loading}}">
    添加并查看</button
  ><view class="row"
    ><text class="small-link" bindtap="load">刷新进展</text
    ><text class="small-link" bindtap="contact">联系 Hannah</text></view
  ></view
>
